note stand-in for vec.om export 0 (bsum d view uchar *): d is (x0 pointer, x1 count). Loops run in
note chunks of 1000000 passes, the seeded compiler's per-loop bound (trap 4 beyond it).
fn bsum d view uchar 16777216 n ulong to ulong
s = ulong 0
for c ulong add div n 1000000 1
o = mul c 1000000
k = sub n o
if gt k 1000000
k = 1000000
end
for i ulong k
s = add s ulong get d add o i
end
end
ret s
end
